§§ `2 תחולה`

-- (א): the employees of the employers in the administrative scale (the
-- unified scale) and in the מח"ר scale whose salary is computed by those
-- scales' agreements and whom the Histadrut represents. (ב): but (1) not the
-- מח"ר psychologists nor those two scales' employees in the employers'
-- hospitals — the framework applies to them; (2) §§3, 6, 7 and 8 (only)
-- not to the fire services' employees of those scales — the framework
-- applies to them; (3) not the youth, society and community education
-- scale ("החינוך המשלים") paid by its own tables, for whom the agreement
-- to be signed with the Ma'of union applies.
DECLARE `scale of 17.5.2012` IS ONE OF
    `the administrative scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `the מח"ר scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `the youth, society and community education scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `the teaching scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `another scale, of 17.5.2012`

@desc An employee, as far as the agreement of 17.5.2012 asks whether it reaches him.
DECLARE `local-government employee of 17.5.2012` HAS
    `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
    `his scale, of 17.5.2012` IS A `scale of 17.5.2012`
    `paid by his scale's agreements, of 17.5.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
    `represented by the Histadrut, of 17.5.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a psychologist, of 17.5.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in a hospital, of 17.5.2012` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the fire services, of 17.5.2012` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_3
GIVEN e IS A `local-government employee of 17.5.2012`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 17.5.2012 covers` e IF
        e's `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012`
    AND (   e's `his scale, of 17.5.2012` EQUALS `the administrative scale, of 17.5.2012`
         OR e's `his scale, of 17.5.2012` EQUALS `the מח"ר scale, of 17.5.2012`)
    AND e's `paid by his scale's agreements, of 17.5.2012`
    AND e's `represented by the Histadrut, of 17.5.2012`
    AND NOT (    e's `his scale, of 17.5.2012` EQUALS `the מח"ר scale, of 17.5.2012`
             AND e's `a psychologist, of 17.5.2012`)
    AND NOT e's `employed in a hospital, of 17.5.2012`

@ref akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_2
`the sections of 17.5.2012 the fire services are out of` MEANS LIST 3, 6, 7, 8

GIVEN `the section` IS A NUMBER, e IS A `local-government employee of 17.5.2012`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a section of 17.5.2012 reaches` `the section` e IF
        `the agreement of 17.5.2012 covers` e
    AND NOT (    e's `employed in the fire services, of 17.5.2012`
             AND elem `the section` `the sections of 17.5.2012 the fire services are out of`)

-- The same, as the Collective Agreements Law asks it (§16).
GIVEN e IS A `local-government employee of 17.5.2012`
GIVETH AN `employee a collective agreement may reach`
DECIDE `the local-government employee of 17.5.2012, as the law asks` e IS
    `employee a collective agreement may reach` WITH
        `his employer is a party to the agreement`  IS e's `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012`
        `his employer is represented for it by an employers' organisation that is a party` IS e's `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012`
        `his employer was or became a member of an employers' organisation that is a party` IS e's `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012`
        `his employer was expressly left out of the agreement` IS FALSE
        `he is of a kind of employee the agreement includes` IS `the agreement of 17.5.2012 covers` e
        `he is in an occupation or post the agreement includes` IS TRUE

`a clerk of a local authority in 2012` MEANS `local-government employee of 17.5.2012` WITH
    `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `his scale, of 17.5.2012` IS `the administrative scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `paid by his scale's agreements, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `represented by the Histadrut, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `a psychologist, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in a hospital, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in the fire services, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE

`a teacher of a local authority in 2012` MEANS `local-government employee of 17.5.2012` WITH
    `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `his scale, of 17.5.2012` IS `the teaching scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `paid by his scale's agreements, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `represented by the Histadrut, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `a psychologist, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in a hospital, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in the fire services, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE

`a youth-education worker of a local authority in 2012` MEANS `local-government employee of 17.5.2012` WITH
    `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `his scale, of 17.5.2012` IS `the youth, society and community education scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `paid by his scale's agreements, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `represented by the Histadrut, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `a psychologist, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in a hospital, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in the fire services, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE

`a fire-services clerk in 2012` MEANS `local-government employee of 17.5.2012` WITH
    `employed by an employer of the agreement of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `his scale, of 17.5.2012` IS `the administrative scale, of 17.5.2012`
    `paid by his scale's agreements, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `represented by the Histadrut, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE
    `a psychologist, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in a hospital, of 17.5.2012` IS FALSE
    `employed in the fire services, of 17.5.2012` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the agreement of 17.5.2012 covers` `a clerk of a local authority in 2012`
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement of 17.5.2012 covers` `a teacher of a local authority in 2012`
#ASSERT NOT `the agreement of 17.5.2012 covers` `a youth-education worker of a local authority in 2012`
#ASSERT `a section of 17.5.2012 reaches` 4 `a fire-services clerk in 2012`
#ASSERT NOT `a section of 17.5.2012 reaches` 3 `a fire-services clerk in 2012`
#ASSERT NOT `the collective agreement applies to the employee` `a general collective agreement` (`the local-government employee of 17.5.2012, as the law asks` `a teacher of a local authority in 2012`)
#ASSERT `the collective agreement applies to the employee` `a general collective agreement` (`the local-government employee of 17.5.2012, as the law asks` `a clerk of a local authority in 2012`)

§§ `3 עדכון תוספת 2011`

-- (א): from 1.1.2012 (January 2012's salary) "תוספת 2011" of the
-- framework's §9 (imported) was raised from 2.25% to 3.75%, its other rules
-- unchanged, and the supplements of §9.8 with it; (ב): from 1.1.2013 to
-- 5.25%; (ג): from 1.7.2013 to 6.25%. (ד): an employee has these rates and
-- not the framework's, or those set under it.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_c akn:art_3__para_d
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 2011 supplement's rate under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013) THEN 6.25%
    ELSE IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) THEN 5.25%
         ELSE IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) THEN 3.75%
              ELSE IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) THEN `the 2011 supplement's first rate`
                   ELSE 0

-- The §9.8 supplements rise with it: a supplement of 1,000 before the 2011
-- supplement is 1,037.50 in 2012.
GIVEN d IS A DATE, amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a §9.8 supplement under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` d amount IS
    amount `increased by` (`the 2011 supplement's rate under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` d)

`the agreement of 17.5.2012's rates replace the framework's` MEANS TRUE

-- Against the framework as amended: each step is one point under the
-- allocation the framework's §10 puts into the supplement by default (4%,
-- 6.25%, 7.25% — imported), save 1.1.2012's quarter point; the rest of the
-- frame is §§4–8.
#ASSERT `the 2011 supplement's rate under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) EQUALS 3.75%
#ASSERT `the rate §10.3 raises the supplement to, as amended` MINUS `the 2011 supplement's rate under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) EQUALS 0.25%
#ASSERT `the rate §10.4(א) raises the supplement to` MINUS `the 2011 supplement's rate under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2013) EQUALS 1%
#ASSERT `the rate §10.4(ב) raises the supplement to` MINUS `the 2011 supplement's rate under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2013) EQUALS 1%
#ASSERT `a §9.8 supplement under the agreement of 17.5.2012 on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2012) 1000 EQUALS 1037.5

§§ `4 תוספת מעו"ף`

-- A grade, as §§4–5 name it: the administrative scale's number (a מח"ר
-- grade is its number less 30: 38 is 8), and whether it carries the stay
-- supplement ("+").
@desc A grade of the administrative or the מח"ר scale, as §§4–5 of the agreement of 17.5.2012 name it.
DECLARE `grade of 17.5.2012` HAS
    `the grade's number, of 17.5.2012` IS A NUMBER @desc the administrative scale's number; a מח"ר grade less 30
    `with the stay supplement, of 17.5.2012` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER, plus IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` n plus IS
    n TIMES 2 PLUS (IF plus THEN 1 ELSE 0)

GIVEN g IS A `grade of 17.5.2012`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g IS
    `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` (g's `the grade's number, of 17.5.2012`) (g's `with the stay supplement, of 17.5.2012`)

-- (א): from 1.10.2012 (October 2012's salary), a monthly supplement by
-- grade, up to 10/40: (1) 4–7 / 34–37, 410; (2) 7+ / 37+, 380; (3) 8 / 38,
-- 300; (4) 8+ / 38+, 220; (5) 9 / 39, 180; (6) 9+ / 39+, 120 (the corpus
-- marks its words "מאה ועשירים" [כך במקור]: 120); (7) 10 / 40, 70; ¶2:
-- 10+ / 40+ and up, none. Named "תוספת מעו"ף" in the administrative scale
-- and "תוספת מח"ר" in the מח"ר scale. Below 4 / 34 no row is printed
-- (convention thresholds.missing-row): nothing.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_6 akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_7 akn:art_4__para_a/p2
GIVEN g IS A `grade of 17.5.2012`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the Ma'of supplement's table amount for` g IS
    IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g LESS THAN `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 4 FALSE THEN NOTHING
    ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g AT MOST `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 7 FALSE THEN JUST 410
         ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 7 TRUE THEN JUST 380
              ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 8 FALSE THEN JUST 300
                   ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 8 TRUE THEN JUST 220
                        ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 9 FALSE THEN JUST 180
