§§ `5 הגדלת התוספת המדורגת`

-- ¶1: from 1.10.2012, in place of §3(ב) of the Ma'of agreement of 2009
-- and on top of its §3(א) (both outside the corpus), for the employees
-- this agreement covers: (א) a monthly "graded supplement" to a full-time
-- employee up to 10+ / 40+: (1) 4–7+ / 34–37+, 235; (2) 8–8+ / 38–38+, 225;
-- (3) 9 / 39, 180; (4) 9+ / 39+, 135; (5) 10 / 40, 90; (6) 10+ / 40+, 45;
-- ¶2: 11 / 41 and up, none. (ב): part-time, pro rata. (ג): promoted or
-- given the stay supplement, the new grade's amount from that day; the
-- examples — 9+ at 135, then 10 at 90; 10+ at 45, then 11 at nothing. Below
-- 4 / 34 no row is printed (convention thresholds.missing-row): nothing.
@ref akn:art_5/p1 akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_6 akn:art_5__para_a/p2 akn:art_5__para_b akn:art_5__para_c
GIVEN g IS A `grade of 17.5.2012`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the graded supplement's table amount for` g IS
    IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g LESS THAN `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 4 FALSE THEN NOTHING
    ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g AT MOST `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 7 TRUE THEN JUST 235
         ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g AT MOST `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 8 TRUE THEN JUST 225
              ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 9 FALSE THEN JUST 180
                   ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 9 TRUE THEN JUST 135
                        ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 10 FALSE THEN JUST 90
                             ELSE IF `the rank of 17.5.2012 of` g EQUALS `the rank of a grade of 17.5.2012` 10 TRUE THEN JUST 45
                                  ELSE JUST 0

GIVEN g IS A `grade of 17.5.2012`, position IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the graded supplement for` g position IS
    CONSIDER `the graded supplement's table amount for` g
    WHEN JUST a THEN a `pro rata to a position of` position
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

