-- authorities' Work Constitution); (2) an assistant in organic classes
-- (§106.1); (3) a pedagogical assistant of severely autistic pupils and
-- pupils with mental disorders or severe retardation (§106.6); (4) the
-- (sole) assistant in a special-education kindergarten (§106.2); (5) an
-- educational assistant in the junior divisions (§106.5); (6) a
-- reinforcement assistant (notice 12/12) — each with the matching role in
-- the three large cities.
@ref akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_5 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_6
