-- counted for the minimum wage; (5): salary for every purpose — the hour
-- value, leave and its redemption, sickness and unused sick days — and part
-- of the determining salary for a budgetary or an accrual pension and for
-- severance; (6): a base of the 3.6% supplement, of no other.
